# Project documentation, kept on disk and out of the repo. None of it is read by the
# build: astro reads src/, apps/logger.md and guides/logger.md, and the content glob
# excludes every README.md. A fresh clone without these loses the signing-key warning
# and the longer notes on schema and voice, so keep your copies. The root README.md is
# the exception — it is the repo's front page and is committed.
BRIEF.md
DEPLOY.md
DESIGN.md
ROADMAP.md
apps/README.md
guides/README.md
tools/sample-output/README.md
